ve \"Marie\" would be pronounced \"まり\".\n\n\"Nice to meet you, I'm Marie! I used to live in the mountains, but all the elders were cramping my style. Down here, I can dress fashionably and eat as much as I want!\"\n\n\"Talents? I can huff and puff super hard!\"\n\n\"Interests? I like prowling for new restaurants!\"\n\nPlease attempt this tongue twister. If you attempt and fail, I would enjoy a recording of that as well. But if you do it on the first try, don't force yourself to fail, haha.\n\n\"裏庭には二羽庭には二羽鶏がいる. Sounds yummy...\"\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/nSYoWvi", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@niui_3/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1153526, "client_id": 702836, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/7ba74cb2-d0bd-44ae-a57c-f69c912a0c67?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1774653519&Signature=gx~SqoG0zqCQB5K4A5SrU4S5RmI4xDk4JeJctZ~7kalAv2V0NMIKOTgAhZr3ScYKKiIsVC8lZNrQEHOt2aXoBvY42J2IOQd2hIYz0hYOYv~1ZbgPNe0tK7WFkGnsazpaDj-V14WNW0psfNsR2son8Wzabq94M8nLGeUhdRCtW7~Qa16nndavDsrSBWFNP5867yi~Ecqx-D0eaB6CxQcEXsA723ZL8TbwAGxDrjllOmas8su0431FFTVqmscInlYqhgX9FrUOJ3O6GbRsEwhAD3peDmoe2GYariLLtaKyxCm7XGka0TiONt0hswPvW3jPZ9oKLS1IEdwPc6JfyDyzbw__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1946405528608944128%2F9-Qh93RI.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2936e80aaa61b398f87dfaf6797a78b8", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1946405528608944128%2F9-Qh93RI.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2936e80aaa61b398f87dfaf6797a78b8, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1946405528608944128%2F9-Qh93RI.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&c